.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974786_3483732988541578_4502993567047372991_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0HL0yssTiZQQ7kNvwEvVflu&_nc_oc=AdqwykznUFUvcHvx2w7JJ-vDT1xcmYhg1m9G4xSaRksqRBb9ea_hk0QaQvRlcQmutvo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-mWHssalQidS5LQv2aNLm5N7juooXyJehlAKaWK7T-Jg&oe=6A369AEA"}, "display_name": "Supermarket VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to Supermarket VR, the supermarket of the future! In this immersive VR experience, you'll travel to a space station where you can shop for groceries.\n\nSupermarket VR is a fun and challenging way to train your cognitive skills in a virtual reality environment. It's perfect for those who want to improve their auditory memory, auditory-visual association and listening in challenging situations, such as understanding speech with distorted sounds or with competitive noises in the environment (auditory closure and auditory figure-ground discrimination).\n\nThis game is designed to be challenging but fun, and it's perfect for players of all ages.", "short_description": "Supermarket VR is a game that transports you to a supermarket on a space station. Train your cognitive skills by memorizing the names of the products on the list, and identifying sounds in a noisy environment. Fun and challenging for players of all ages."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://termos.probrain.com.br/pub/policies/policies_eng.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ProBrain Solu\u00e7\u00f5es Neurotecnol\u00f3gicas para Sa\u00fade e Educa\u00e7\u00e3o Ltda", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.probrain.com.br/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads"